<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MIXED DOUBLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MIXED DOUBLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mixed doubles results at the</p>
<p>Wimbledon tennis championships on Thursday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Justin Gimelstob (U.S.)/Chanda Rubin (U.S.) beat Murphy Jensen</p>
<p>(U.S.)/Brenda Schultz-Mccarthy (Netherlands) 7-5 6-7 (5-7) 6-1</p>
<p>10-Donald Johnson (U.S.)/Linda Wild (U.S.) beat Henrik Jan</p>
<p>Davids (Netherlands)/Miriam Oremans (Netherlands) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Tom Nijssen (Netherlands)/Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Mark</p>
<p>Keil (U.S.)/Ginger Helgeson Nielsen (U.S.) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>3-Andrei Olhovskiy (Russia)/Larisa Neiland (Latvia) beat Peter</p>
<p>Nyborg (Sweden)/Asa Carlsson (Sweden) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>5-Rick Leach (U.S.)/Manon Bollegraf (Netherlands) beat Mark</p>
<p>Petchey (Britain)/Clare Wood (Britain) 7-6 (7-4) 6-3</p>
<p>Danny Sapsford (Britain)/Shirli-Ann Siddall (Britain) beat</p>
<p>10-Donald Johnson (U.S.)/Linda Wild (U.S.) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>John-Laffnie De Jager (South Africa)/Martina Hingis</p>
<p>(Switzerland) beat 2-Patrick Galbraith (U.S.)/Lisa Raymond</p>
<p>(U.S.) 6-4 0-6 10-8</p>
<p>4-Cyril Suk (Czech Republic)/Helena Sukova (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>beat Justin Gimelstob (U.S.)/Chanda Rubin (U.S.) 7-6 (7-2) 6-1</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>1-Grant Connell (Canada)/Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat T.j.</p>
<p>Middleton (U.S.)/Lori McNeil (U.S.) 4-6 7-6 (7-2) 6-4</p>
<p>Tom Nijssen (Netherlands)/Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat 7-David</p>
<p>Adams (South Africa)/Alexandra Fusai (France) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>3-Andrei Olhovskiy (Russia)/Larisa Neiland (Latvia) beat Wayne</p>
<p>Arthurs (Australia)/Tina Krizan (Slovenia) 6-2 7-6 (7-4)</p>
</text>
